Module longrisk "A long way with ice on it" {
  // The Road the Star Came Down's B1: a way that takes hours, with something dangerous on it, risked. The company
  // sets out, takes the risk, and must not be told on the way that the way is no longer open.
  Place scarp "the scarp" is wilderness.
  Place foot "the foot of the climb" is room within scarp at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place ledge "the high ledge" is room within scarp at 1, 0 outdoors.
  Passage climb "the wet climb" is path between foot and ledge taking 12 hours.
  Company party "You" of 1 at foot.
  Hazard ice_fall "the ice" means "Deal (1d4) bludgeoning damage to ally unless dexterity save against (8).".
  Thing ice "ice on the links" on climb {
    State icy dangerous "Ice glazes the links of the climb.".
    State broken "The ice on the links is broken where you went up.".
    Hurts with ice_fall when icy then broken.
  }
  Observe foot_scene at foot when true "A wet climb of iron links goes up the scarp.".
  Observe ledge_scene at ledge when true "A ledge high over the valley.".
  Goal false.
}
